flowchart LR
    RGB[RGB] --> HIFI[HiFi-CS grounder]
    LANG[Language] --> HIFI
    HIFI --> COARSE[Coarse target probability / mask]
    COARSE --> PROMPT[Prompt builder: box + interior points]
    PROMPT --> TRACKER[Hugging Face SAM 3 Tracker<br/>macOS CPU, float32]
    TRACKER --> SELECT[No-GT mask selector + safe fallback]
    COARSE -. HiFi-CS fallback .-> SELECT
    SELECT --> REFINED[Refined target mask]
    REFINED --> DEX[Dex-Net antipodal sampler]
    COARSE -. frozen baseline .-> DEX
    DEPTH[Full depth, unchanged] --> DEX
    DEX --> FIXED[Fixed planar 4-DoF candidates]
    FIXED --> GQ[GQ-CNN-2.1 q-value ranking]
    FIXED --> GEO[Target-aware geometric re-ranking]
    GQ --> EVAL[Paired 2D consistency evaluation]
    GEO --> EVAL
